composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2032189Z Note: a multi-user installation is possible. See https://nix.dev/manual/nix/stable/installation/installing-binary.html#multi-user-installation
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2039623Z ^[[1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer^[[0m
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2132708Z ^[[32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2142469Z ^[[0m
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2147540Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2148941Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2149369Z 
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2149717Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2150503Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2150918Z 
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2151749Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2152452Z    if you are ready to continue.
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2152836Z 
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2153887Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2155441Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2156307Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2156986Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2157288Z 
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2157668Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2158041Z 
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2158640Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2159394Z    can use Nix.
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2159713Z 
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2159916Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2160209Z 
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2160821Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2161622Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2162065Z 
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2162313Z I will:
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2162764Z 
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2163129Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2163914Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2164707Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2165395Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2165975Z  - install Nix in /nix
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2166623Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2168030Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2169194Z    /root
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2169879Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2171649Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2178112Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2179233Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2179662Z 
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2180845Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mReady to continue?
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2181831Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2197756Z 
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2198682Z ^[[34m---- let's talk about sudo -----------------------------------------------------
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2207504Z ^[[0mThis script is going to call sudo a lot. Normally, it would show you
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2208642Z exactly what commands it is running and why. However, the script is
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2209369Z run in a headless fashion, like this:
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2209702Z 
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2210079Z   $ curl -L https://nixos.org/nix/install | sh
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2210449Z 
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2210926Z or maybe in a CI pipeline. Because of that, I'm going to skip the
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2211615Z verbose output in the interest of brevity.
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2212012Z 
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2212218Z If you would like to
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2212788Z see the output, try like this:
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2213156Z 
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2213481Z   $ curl -L -o install-nix https://nixos.org/nix/install
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2214131Z   $ sh ./install-nix
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2214450Z 
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.2214508Z 
