conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6455389Z ^[[32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6464957Z ^[[0m
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6465569Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6466145Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6466555Z 
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6466910Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6467468Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6467771Z 
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6468098Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6468994Z    if you are ready to continue.
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6469289Z 
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6469846Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6470586Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6471332Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6471841Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6472163Z 
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6472436Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6472749Z 
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6472992Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6473534Z    can use Nix.
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6473700Z 
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6473860Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6474036Z 
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6475296Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
