conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6476457Z I will:
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6476783Z 
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6477439Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
