conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6482195Z    /root
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6487521Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6488093Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6497605Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6498218Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
