conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.8586315Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.8586973Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
