conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.8587695Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.8588867Z    if you are ready to continue.
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.8589199Z 
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.8590501Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.8592081Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.8593257Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.8593965Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
