project-sdk-sources	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:51.4690893Z ^[[32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
project-sdk-sources	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:51.4699700Z ^[[0m
project-sdk-sources	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:51.4700187Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
project-sdk-sources	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:51.4700467Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
project-sdk-sources	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:51.4700696Z 
project-sdk-sources	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:51.4701724Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
project-sdk-sources	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:51.4702301Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
project-sdk-sources	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:51.4702536Z 
project-sdk-sources	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:51.4703092Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
project-sdk-sources	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:51.4703438Z    if you are ready to continue.
project-sdk-sources	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:51.4703628Z 
project-sdk-sources	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:51.4704021Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
project-sdk-sources	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:51.4704470Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
project-sdk-sources	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:51.4704874Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
project-sdk-sources	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:51.4705175Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
project-sdk-sources	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:51.4705333Z 
project-sdk-sources	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:51.4705490Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
project-sdk-sources	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:51.4705749Z 
project-sdk-sources	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:51.4705932Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
