legacy-maven	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6564770Z ^[[32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
legacy-maven	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6575620Z ^[[0m
legacy-maven	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6576093Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
legacy-maven	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6576526Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
legacy-maven	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6576946Z 
legacy-maven	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6577273Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
legacy-maven	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6578071Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
legacy-maven	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6578566Z 
legacy-maven	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6579447Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
legacy-maven	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6580178Z    if you are ready to continue.
legacy-maven	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6580484Z 
legacy-maven	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6581098Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
legacy-maven	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6581892Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
legacy-maven	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6582310Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
legacy-maven	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6582642Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
legacy-maven	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6582803Z 
legacy-maven	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6582956Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
legacy-maven	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6583202Z 
legacy-maven	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6583484Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
legacy-maven	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6583879Z    can use Nix.
legacy-maven	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6584012Z 
legacy-maven	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6584117Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
legacy-maven	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6584263Z 
