legacy-maven	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6585013Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
legacy-maven	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6590182Z 
legacy-maven	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6590364Z I will:
legacy-maven	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6590641Z 
legacy-maven	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:53.6590908Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
