conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.2519021Z Note: a multi-user installation is possible. See https://nix.dev/manual/nix/stable/installation/installing-binary.html#multi-user-installation
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.2527947Z ^[[1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer^[[0m
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.2622751Z ^[[32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.2632369Z ^[[0m
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.2632971Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.2633801Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.2634144Z 
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.2634862Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.2635878Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.2636241Z 
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.2636833Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.2638230Z    if you are ready to continue.
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.2638745Z 
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.2641615Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.2645191Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.2646378Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.2647559Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.2647978Z 
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.2648252Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.2648537Z 
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.2648792Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.2649482Z    can use Nix.
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.2649674Z 
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.2649851Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.2650052Z 
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.2650465Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.2651127Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.2651436Z 
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.2651622Z I will:
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.2652015Z 
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.2652419Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.2652970Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.2653506Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.2654040Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.2654384Z  - install Nix in /nix
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.2654752Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.2655267Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.2655693Z    /root
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.2658094Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.2658657Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.2669363Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.2670116Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.2670449Z 
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.2672372Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mReady to continue?
conformance-offline (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T20:46:54.2673461Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
